{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-drift-model-monitoring/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-monitoring","title":"为何模型监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-drift-model-monitoring/foundations/why-monitoring","wordCount":1858,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"drift-types","title":"漂移类型 (协变量/标签/概念)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-drift-model-monitoring/foundations/drift-types","wordCount":1903,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"monitoring-spectrum","title":"监控谱系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-drift-model-monitoring/foundations/monitoring-spectrum","wordCount":1757,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础\">基础</h1><p>机器学习的训练假设里藏着一句很少被说出口的话：未来的数据会和过去长得一样。这个假设在论文和 Kaggle 比赛里成立，在生产环境里几乎从不成立。本章的任务是把这句隐含假设挖出来、拆开、命名，让后面所有的检测与处置都有清晰的靶子。</p>\n<p>三篇文档层层递进。第一篇《为何模型监控》回答「为什么非监控不可」：模型失效是无声的，离线指标好不代表线上不退化，监控的本质是把这种沉默变成信号，它和测试、和一次性评估的区别在哪里。第二篇《漂移类型》是全 hub 的概念基石，把笼统的「数据变了」精确分解为协变量漂移（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(X)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 变）、标签漂移（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(Y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 变）、概念漂移（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Y</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(Y\\mid X)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 变）三类，并区分突变、渐变、周期性等时间形态——后面检测章和性能章反复引用的术语都在这里定义。第三篇《监控谱系》把视野拉宽：监控不是单点指标，而是从数据管道健康、到输入分布、到预测分布、再到业务指标的一整条谱系，本章帮你看清自己手上的指标处在谱系的哪一层。</p>\n<p>在整个 hub 里，本章是地基。检测章解决「怎么测漂移」，但测什么、漂移分几种，由本章定义；性能章解决「性能掉了怎么发现」，但「性能退化是漂移的后果而非漂移本身」这个关键区分，也在本章建立。建议第一次学习时严格按 1→2→3 的顺序读完本章，再进入后续章节。</p>\n"}